...@../../../dev/d2/themes/routing
# Core design only; source identities and proof receipts remain in Org.
title: WEAVER / CONFIGURABLE ROUTINES / GOVERNED ROUTING {
  class: title
  near: top-center
}
authoring: SCHEME + JSON / YAML {
  top: 0
  left: 0
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f7faf9"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  mcp: Scheme prototypes and composition\nReusable business and agent routines\nOne owned Type / Contract model {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }
  a2a: JSON and YAML declarative inputs\nRegistered routine / capability references\nSame admitted semantic projection {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }
  acp: Bound source evaluation and imports\nAuthenticate the complete closure\nNo arbitrary code in request data {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }

}
semantic: POO / SEMANTIC PROGRAM {
  top: 0
  left: 440
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f8fafb"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  origin: Typed routine graph and artifact flow\nCapability and response Contracts\nBounded attempts / parallelism {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  alias: Cedar Code as Policy\nCompile routine and route constraints\nAuthentic current facts at execution {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
  query: Bind the original task and node\nClaim / input / budget / history\nConfiguration never creates authority {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
}
cloud: GO / CLOUD NATIVE CONTROL {
  top: 0
  left: 880
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f7faf9"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  projection: Publish one admitted package closure\nSource / Contracts / policy / adapters\nResolve the same outcome on retry {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  join: Kubernetes and capability discovery\nModels / MCP tools / A2A / Client ACP\nDescriptions and advice are not grants {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
  fence: Pin the invocation semantic program\nNew defaults for new work\nCurrent hard withdrawals still apply {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
  goBrand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/go.svg
    top: 247
    left: 24
    width: 42
    height: 22
  }
  kubernetesBrand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/kubernetes.svg
    top: 247
    left: 82
    width: 28
    height: 28
  }
}
execution: RUST / LLM AND AGENT EXECUTION {
  top: 0
  left: 1320
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f8fafb"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  cas: Filter required capabilities and Policy\nThen rank cost / quality / latency\nSelect one eligible concrete binding {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
  alias: Bind actual wire and final broker claim\nRecheck current Policy and reservation\nUnknown send keeps its original hold {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
  hold: Bounded streams and typed tool proposals\nGovern response release and next effects\nAttribute usage to the original task {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  rustBrand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/rust.svg
    top: 40
    left: 156
    width: 34
    height: 34
  }
}
quint: QUINT\nConfig weakening / provider changes / pinned routines\nPolicy churn / hidden retries / unknown outcomes {
  top: 810
  left: 220
  width: 610
  height: 100
  class: policy
}
lean: LEAN\nSemantic refinement / candidate narrowing / actual routing\nOriginal claim and shared account composition {
  top: 810
  left: 960
  width: 610
  height: 100
  class: semantic
}
authoring.mcp -> semantic.origin
authoring.a2a -> semantic.alias
authoring.acp -> semantic.query
semantic.origin -> cloud.projection
semantic.alias -> cloud.join
semantic.query -> cloud.fence { style.stroke-dash: 4 }
cloud.projection -> cloud.join
cloud.join -> cloud.fence
cloud.fence -> execution.cas
execution.cas -> execution.alias
execution.alias -> execution.hold
execution.hold -> execution.cas: Read current prefix { style.stroke-dash: 4 }

